---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="section pipeline" id="pipeline">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Pipelines</h2>
    <p class="pipeline-lead">Chain dependent agents into a DAG — outputs flow downstream, fan-out and fan-in resolve automatically, and the web UI renders the live run graph.</p>
    <img src={`${base}media/web-pipeline.png`} alt="Warden's web Pipelines view: a running checkout-hardening pipeline fans one completed root job into two running tasks, then joins them before integration."
      class="pipeline-image" />
  </div>
</section>
